 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "You ready to go?\nTo the ADDC, I mean?": "",
  "I'm gonna grab a taxi for us.\nI'll wait for you over on Park Boulevard.": "",
  "I'm going to grab a taxi for us.\nI'll wait for you on Park Boulevard.": "",
  "Over here, Yagami-san!\nI have a taxi for us!": "",
  "Yagami-san, over here!\nI have a taxi for us!": "",
  "The ADDC, huh?": "",
  "This has gotta be fate or somethin'...": "",
  "Don't get the wrong idea.": "",
  "Don't get the wrong idea, yeah?": "",
  "I'm not one of your little buddies.\nRemember that.": "",
  "I'm not one of your little buddies.": "",
  "Do you have an appointment, sir?": "",
  "I don't, sorry. My name is Hoshino, from the Genda\nLaw Office. This is my partner, Yagami.": "",
  "No, sorry... I'm Hoshino, from the Genda Law Office.\nThis is my partner, Yagami.": "",
  "We're here to talk about a murder\nthat took place in Kamurocho yesterday.": "",
  "You see, we're investigating a murder\nthat happened in Kamurocho.": "",
  "A murder...?": "",
  "Ah...?": "",
  "A coworker of ours, name's Shintani.\nHe was the victim.": "",
  "One of our lawyers, Shintani,\nwas the victim.": "",
  "We have a record that he called\nthis center before he was killed.": "",
  "As far as we can tell, he called this center\nbefore he was killed.": "",
  "We're hoping you could help us track down\nexactly who he spoke to?": "",
  "If it's all right, could we maybe find out\nwho he spoke to?": "",
  "I'm very sorry, sir...\nBut I can't provide such private information.": "",
  "I'm very sorry, sir...\nbut I can't provide such private information.": "",
  "Not the friendliest girl in town, huh?": "",
  "We're not exactly welcome guests here.": "",
  "Guess we're not really welcome here.": "",
  "After I busted my ass to pass the bar,\nI always figured I'd have my pick of the ladies...": "",
  "After I worked so hard to pass the bar and everything.\nI was thinking the ladies'd come flocking to me...": "",
  "Right this way, please.": "",
  "Straight ahead is the ADDC's general ward.\nWaku-san's room is on the 4th floor.": "",
  "Let's get this over with already.": "",
  "Come on, let's get this\nover with already.": "",
  "Okubo's going down,\nno matter how you slice it.": "",
  "(I need to follow Terasawa-san.)": "",
  "Hey, Yagami. You're never gonna last\nif you keep taking cases like this.": "",
  "Criminal suits are a constant test of your conviction.\nYour sense of justice.": "",
  "They don't even pay that well.": "",
  "Careful who you say that around.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Careful who you say that around.": "",
  "Look, just chill out, okay?": "",
  "Take it from me.": "",
  "Take it from me. I've been around\nthe block way longer than you have.": "",
  "I've been around the block\nway longer than you have.": "",
  "This was the room assigned to Waku-san.": "",
  "This was Waku-san's room.": "",
  "What's down there?": "",
  "That's the research wing where\nthey develop all our new drugs.": "",
  "That leads to the pharmaceutical research wing.\nThey develop all our new drugs there.": "",
  "Oh.": "",
  "You can't get in without a gold keycard,\nthough. Not even I have one.": "",
  "You can't get in without a gold keycard, though.\nNot even I have one.": "",
  "Gold, huh?": "",
  "...Gold, huh?": "",
  "I suppose because it's the heart\nof the Center's operations.": "",
  "Heh, sounds like it's a whole nother world\nback there. Security like that must be a bitch.": "",
  "Heh, sounds like a whole 'nother\nhigh-security world back there.": "",
  "C'mon, Yagami.": "",
  "Before he died, Waku-san spent\nmost of his time in here.": "",
  "This is the room Waku-san stayed in\nbefore his death.": "",
  "And when was he admitted?": "",
  "Two years ago, with Alzheimer's.": "",
  "Two years ago. With Alzheimer's.": "",
  "Some kinda dementia, right?": "",
  "So he had dementia?": "",
  "Alzheimer's is a neurodegenerative disease\nthat leads to dementia, yes.": "",
  "In fact, it's the cause of almost\n70% of all dementia cases.": "",
  "In fact, Alzheimer's is the cause of almost\n70% of all dementia cases.": "",
  "So they're one in the same kinda?": "",
  "So we're just mincing words, right?": "",
  "Anyway. Do what you gotta do, Yagami.": "",
  "All right, Yagami...\nDo what you gotta do.": "",
  "Has anyone else slept here\nsince Waku-san's death?": "",
  "Since Waku-san's death, has anyone else\nslept in this room?": "",
  "Nobody, no.": "",
  "And Waku-san was missing from his room\nthe morning of the incident, yes?": "",
  "And on the morning of the incident,\nWaku-san was missing from his room, yes?": "",
  "So he was murdered here,\nthen carried out.": "",
  "I can't say for sure...\nBut it's likely.": "",
  "I can't say for sure...\nbut it's likely.": "",
  "(Working on that assumption,\nhow was his body carried outside?)": "",
  "(I should look a little closer.)": "",
  "Waku-san was here until the morning of the incident,\nthen he just up and disappeared...": "",
  "Waku-san was here until\nthe morning of the incident...": "",
  "All the rooms have windows\nlike this, right?": "",
  "It seems like people would notice\nif something was going on in here.": "",
  "If something was going on in here,\nsurely someone outside would notice.": "",
  "Well, we only have so many\nemployees in this ward...": "",
  "I'm not sure how quickly.\nThis ward has a smaller staff...": "",
  "The halls stay fairly busy, but it's mostly\ndementia patients moving between appointments.": "",
  "People do walk the halls often,\nbut that's mostly just other dementia patients.": "",
  "I see. I wonder how the room\nlooks from the hallway.": "",
  "I wonder how well you can see\nin here from the hallway...": "",
  "Can you really tell what's going on from out there?": "",
  "The window's sealed shut. There's no way\nWaku-san could have escaped through here.": "",
  "This window doesn't even open.\nThere's no way anyone got out here.": "",
  "You got all you need from here, yeah?": "",
  "I think you've looked at everything. Satisfied?": "",
  "(Terasawa-san...\nA nurse at the ADDC hospital.)": "",
  "(Doesn't look too happy. Probably because Shintani-sensei\nhas been a creep since he laid eyes on her.)": "",
  "(Or maybe she's just always tense.)": "",
  "(Is this a standard nurse uniform these days?\nWait... Why am I investigating this?)": "",
  "(I... really shouldn't stare like this.)": "",
  "(She's gonna think I'm no better\nthan Shintani-sensei.)": "",
  "(Masamichi Shintani, self-proclaimed king\nof the Genda Law Office.)": "",
  "(40 years old, single and looking.\nHobbies include leering and being condescending.)": "",
  "(An attorney's badge. Lots of people don't even bother\nto wear theirs.)": "",
  "(Shintani-sensei always keeps his\nfront and center, though.)": "",
  "Hm, you can definitely see what's\ngoing on from out here.": "",
  "Seems about right.\nYou can definitely see in from the hallway.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei, can you\nlay on the bed for me?": "",
  "Sure thing.\nYou wanna join me, Terasawa-chan?": "",
  "Uh, I guess so. Care to join me,\nTerasawa-san? What have you got to lose?": "",
  "Sure, want me to just take a nap?\nHey, care to join me, Terasawa-chan?": "",
  "It was a joke!": "",
  "So from this vantage point,\nyou can't make out the person's face...": "",
  "So you can't see the person's face...\nNot from the hallway, at least.": "",
  "(I've gotta go check out\nWaku-san's room.)": "",
  "So, was this the collossal waste\nof time I knew it'd be?": "",
  "Well? This whole thing was\na waste of time, right?": "",
  "Nope. I got something I'd only\nget from being here.": "",
  "Nope. I found some clues I could only get\nfrom the scene of the crime.": "",
  "Does it matter? It's been days.\nThe case is practically closed.": "",
  "This murder happened weeks ago.\nThe cops are closing the book.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo is guilty as hell.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo is a guilty man.": "",
  "According to him, he's not.": "",
  "Last I heard, he's pleading innocent.": "",
  "Well of course that's what he says.\nConsider the facts though, man.": "",
  "That seems like a pretty long shot,\nconsidering the facts.": "",
  "You wanna review the case?": "",
  "So, you wanna review the case?": "",
  "Sure, let's go over\nwhat we know so far.": "",
  "Whatever you want.": "",
  "Okay, let's run the facts.": "",
  "You can't see person's face\nfrom the hallway...": "",
  "You can't see the patient's face\nfrom the hallway...": "",
  "All right, here we go.": "",
  "Here we go.": "",
  "Our victim was the patient staying in this room:\nKoichi Waku. Male. Age 66.": "",
  "Our victim was the patient staying in this room:\nKoichi Waku. Age 66.": "",
  "At 8:30 AM on the morning of the crime,\nthe nurses noticed he was missing from his bed.": "",
  "Given Waku's degenerative state, they assumed\nhe was wandering around the hospital somewhere.": "",
  "Given Waku's degenerative state,\nthey assumed he was wandering around somewhere.": "",
  "But after being unable to track him down,\nhospital staff filed a missing person's report.": "",
  "But when they couldn't find him,\nhospital staff filed a missing persons report.": "",
  "You know what a dementia patient's like, though.\nHard to imagine they'd make it outside on their own.": "",
  "You know what a dementia patient's like, though.\nHard to imagine they'd make it outside.": "",
  "The only conclusion, then, was that somebody\nmust've taken him out of the hospital.": "",
  "With that in mind, the police concluded that\nsomebody must've taken him out of the hospital.": "",
  "After inspecting all the cars that came in and out\nof the Center, they were left with one possible suspect.": "",
  "After inspecting all cars that came in and out of the Center,\nthey were left with one possible suspect.": "",
  "A laundry man by the name of Shinpei Okubo.": "",
  "A laundry man, by the name\nof Shinpei Okubo.": "",
  "It didn't take much prodding for Okubo to confess\nburying Waku's body out in the mountains.": "",
  "And lo and behold, three months after Waku disappeared,\nthe cops found his body rotting away right where Okubo said it'd be.": "",
  "And three months after Waku disappeared, the cops\nfound the body right where Okubo said it'd be.": "",
  "Cause of death was most likely suffocation,\nbut they still don't know for sure.": "",
  "Any objections to this so far...\nYagami-sensei?": "",
  "Any objections so far... Yagami-sensei?": "",
  "Actually, yeah.\nYou're forgetting something.": "",
  "And what's that?": "",
  "Okubo-kun insists he didn't kill anyone.": "",
  "Okubo-kun still insists he didn't\nkill anyone.": "",
  "All he admits to is dumping the body.": "",
  "He confessed, but only to\ndumping the body itself.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(You can't say for sure that the guy who\ndumped the body actually committed the murder.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If I budge on that, I'd be admitting\nOkubo-kun did it before the trial even started.)</color>": "",
  "Oh, sure.": "",
  "But come on, Yagami. The guy's got a history\nof assault, and it's on record.": "",
  "Think about the context, though.\nThe guy's got a history of assault, right?": "",
  "Roughed up his girlfriend.\nAccidentally broke her finger.": "",
  "He broke his girlfriend's finger.": "",
  "Right, but that was over six years ago.": "",
  "Sure, six years ago.": "",
  "He was just a kid.\nGot drunk, made a huge mistake.": "",
  "He was just a kid.\nCould've gotten drunk, made a mistake.": "",
  "And what, it's okay for a kid\nto hit a woman?": "",
  "So it's okay to hit a girl if you're a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>kid</font_kind>?": "",
  "Of course not.\nBut that's not what he's on trial for.": "",
  "No. The law might not have\njudged him for it, but I do.": "",
  "I don't condone what he did, but legally, committing\none crime doesn't mean you're guilty of another.": "",
  "But still. That doesn't necessarily mean\nhe's guilty this time, too.": "",
  "Fine, but what about Okubo's shaky alibi?": "",
  "What about Okubo's testimony?": "",
  "He said he left the Center at 10 AM,\nafter grabbing the sheets from the general ward.": "",
  "Then it wasn't until he got to the linen supplier\nthat he discovered the body.": "",
  "Claimed Waku-san's corpse \"somehow\"\ngot loaded into his truck.": "",
  "Claimed Waku-san's corpse \"somehow\"\ngot mixed in the sheets on his truck.": "",
  "Who's gonna believe garbage like that?": "",
  "Who'd believe a garbage alibi like that?": "",
  "If anyone should, it's his lawyers.": "",
  "If anyone's gonna believe him,\nit should be his lawyers.": "",
  "Hmph. We're meeting with\nOkubo after this, right?": "",
  "Well, we're going to meet with Okubo ourselves\nafter this, right?": "",
  "You should just be honest with him.\nTell him the case is unwinnable.": "",
  "Just be honest with him.\nTell him the case is unwinnable.": "",
  "Are you two done here?": "",
  "Yup. Can you show us the garage next?\nThe one where Okubo-kun parked his truck.": "",
  "Yup. How about you show us the parking garage\nwhere Okubo-kun parked his truck, Terasawa-chan?": "",
  "The service entrance, I think it was.": "",
  "The service entrance, right?": "",
  "That's the only other place\nwe'll need to see today.": "",
  "That's our last stop,\nthen I think we're done.": "",
  "We'll need to take an elevator\ndown there. Follow me.": "",
  "We'll need to take an elevator down to the\nservice entrance garage. Follow me.": "",
  "Looks like a regular old garage to me.": "",
  "Seems like a regular old garage to me.": "",
  "Hm. You'd make it out with no problem if you\nput a body into your truck down here. It's quiet.": "",
  "Look. You'd make it out no problem\nif you put a body in a truck down here.": "",
  "I suppose.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami.\nCheck this out.": "",
  "These are the carts they use\nto collect sheets and linens.": "",
  "Day of the crime, Okubo was all over\nthe hospital with one of these things.": "",
  "Okubo took one of these\nall over the hospital.": "",
  "It would've been simple for him to sneak\na body in there and cart it right out.": "",
  "With one of these on hand, he could easily\nsneak a body in there and cart it right out.": "",
  "Maybe so.": "",
  "Where was Okubo parked\non the day of the incident?": "",
  "On the day of the incident, where was\nOkubo specifically parked?": "",
  "Oh, um...": "",
  "Right about here.": "",
  "The truck was parked here with the back\nfacing the elevator. Here's a recreation of it.": "",
  "The truck was parked with the back facing the elevator.\nHere's a recreation of it.": "",
  "DNA evidence from the victim was found\nin the flatbed of the truck.": "",
  "The truck was two tons. DNA evidence\nfrom the victim was found in the flatbed.": "",
  "That's proof enough that the body was there.": "",
  "And when they confronted Okubo,\nhe flat out admitted it.": "",
  "And when they confronted him,\nOkubo flat out admitted it.": "",
  "So the body was hidden in a laundry basket,\nand taken out through here...": "",
  "So as far as we know, he took the body\nout through here in a laundry cart...": "",
  "There was evidence that the body\nwas in Okubo's truck...": "",
  "When was Waku-san last seen?": "",
  "Um, when was Waku-san last seen?": "",
  "Just before 8 AM on the day of the crime.": "",
  "Yeah. 7:50, to be precise.\nAn ADDC scientist will be testifying to that.": "",
  "He claims he saw him\nnice and cozy in his bed.": "",
  "I see. Can we talk to this witness?": "",
  "I see. And can we talk to this witness?": "",
  "I tried to get an appointment, but they shut me down.\nSaid they don't want us interfering with their research anymore.": "",
  "Nope. I couldn't get an appointment.\nSaid they couldn't have their research interrupted.": "",
  "They're not willing to make\nan exception this once?": "",
  "What, they can't make\nan exception this once?": "",
  "This isn't an issue you wanna push, Yagami. Worst-case\nscenario, you get charged with witness intimidation.": "",
  "Fact is, we can't be that emphatic about it.\nWe could get charged with witness intimidation, so drop it.": "",
  "All right, all right. Anyway.\nThe victim was last seen at 7:50.": "",
  "I get it. Well...\nAnyway. The victim was last seen at 7:50.": "",
  "That's right. Breakfast is at 8 o'clock, so the patients\nwho can walk on their own gather in the break room.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Don't get the wrong idea.": "อย่าเข้าใจผิดไปเองนะ",
  "Ah...?": "อ้า...?",
  "Right this way, please.": "เชิญทางนี้ครับ",
  "Oh.": "อ้อ.",
  "All right, here we go.": "เอาล่ะ ไปกันเลย",
  "Here we go.": "มาเริ่มกันเลย",
  "And what's that?": "แล้วมันคืออะไรล่ะ?",
  "Oh, sure.": "อืม ใช่สิ",
  "I suppose.": "ก็คงอย่างนั้น",
  "Maybe so.": "ก็อาจจะใช่นะ"
 }
}
